# The defaults, sys/lba.cfg's values where lba.cfg leaves the port's
# keys out (fixtures/defaults: sys/lba.cfg's 1994 keys alone, recorded
# with -D 1920x1080). Escape in the logo's fade from white cuts it
# (SkipLogo), and the main menu is LBA2's (SaveAnywhere). A new game
# named abc, its text and movie cut short, comes in the cell on the
# wide screen of 852x480 (WideScreen), the tunes from the XMIDI, as
# Auto takes it on this CD (MusicTracks, MusicJingles). Sporty (F2),
# Twinsen runs into the cell's wall and on along it, Hit walls off
# (LbaWinSettings 212), and Escape opens LBA2's menu over the game,
# whose first entry gives it back. shipped derives from this record
# with each of the port's keys set as sys/lba.cfg sets it, the same
# screens.

sleep 5.1
key Escape
sleep 0.5
shot cut
sleep 35
shot menu
key Return
sleep 4
shot name
key a b c
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 6
shot text
key Escape
sleep 8
shot movie
key Escape
sleep 10
shot cell
key F2
sleep 1
down Up
sleep 4
up Up
shot ran
sleep 2
shot after
key Escape
sleep 3
shot lba2menu
key Return
sleep 3
shot resumed
